step The Marris Stead
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride south to the Marris Stead, the farm north-west of Darrowshire. The three agents' remains are bone outlines on the ground: one by the road south of the farm, one on the hill east of the house, one on the mound in front of it. Coming close enough to see the Blightcaller in front of the house completes the scouting.
  tip Careful: Nathanos Blightcaller (level 62 elite) and his elite hounds stand in front of the house: take the remains on the mound from the side and do not pull him. You don't have to fight him.
  collect 16003 quest 6185.1          -- SI:7 Insignia (Rutger)
  collect 16002 quest 6185.3          -- SI:7 Insignia (Turyen)
  collect 16001 quest 6185.2          -- SI:7 Insignia (Fredo)
