step Level 59.93
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Cross the river east of Tirion into Terrordale. The Terrordale Spirits haunt the woods there. Top up here to level 59.93 before the hand-ins at Chillwind Camp: they take you to level 60. Or, with a group, run the Scholomance dungeon or the Stratholme dungeon instead.
  level 59.93 grind 14564 -- grind on Terrordale Spirit at Terrordale, Eastern Plaguelands

